      "composition": "single-ornament",
      "description": "A very tall engraved candelabrum panel between thin vertical rules. From the bottom up, a bearded goat-legged satyr sits before a tasselled pedestal holding a violin and its bow; a blank cartouche between dolphins and trophies of arms; a large fluted urn with a bearded mask and cornucopias curling from its sides; two naked children embracing in a bower of acanthus and vine; a hanging cuirass with plumed helmet and shield; crossed staffs bound with a cord; and a lidded urn at the top among vine leaves and grapes. Dark brown-grey ink; the grey paper tone of the plate is kept at partial opacity.",
