      "composition": "single-ornament",
      "description": "A tall symmetrical engraved candelabrum panel. A central shaft rises from a garlanded pedestal through a basket-weave bowl to a wide scale-patterned bowl at the top, where the plate edge cuts it. Two scaly dragons coil at the base; two winged sphinx-like creatures, one human-faced and one lion-headed, perch on the middle bowl facing each other; wheeled cannon jut out to both sides among a drum, a shield, a plumed helmet and a cuirass; two horned masks sprout acanthus at the top corners. Dark brown ink, the tan paper tone kept inside the forms, on a transparent background.",
